    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">formātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		formo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a shaping</i>, <i>forming; a form</i>, <i>design</i>, <i>plan</i> (post-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">formationem puto probandam, locum improbandum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2 praef.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oblonga fori,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 5,
				1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">formationes columnarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
				1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">morum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 117, 20</span></i>
			.</div>
